{
  "name": "Blood Curse of the Howl",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>As a Bonus Action, you unleash a bloodcurdling howl. Each creature within 30 feet of you that can hear you must succeed on a Wisdom Saving Throw or have Disadvantage on Attack Rolls and Ability Checks until the end of your next turn. You can choose any number of creatures you can see to be unaffected by the howl.</p><p><strong>Amplify.</strong> The range of this curse increases to 60 feet.</p>",
